{"item_uid": "指考94-geography-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔76分)", "stem": "台灣目前市場流行的有機農產品，最主要是下列哪些(社會)變遷的結果？\n(甲)消費者追求健康飲食的趨勢 (乙)農業生產與行銷策略的變更\n(丙)社會追求自然資源永續利用 (丁)城鄉差異與貧富差距日益擴大\n(戊)老年人口飲食消費需求降低", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "甲丙戊", "C": "甲丙丁", "D": "乙丁戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "1-3", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 95.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 99.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 89.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 1.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 95.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 89.0, "discrimination": 10.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 98.0, 97.0, 96.0, 85.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
